  "description": "ToolUp.AI.Wire — a portable, Fable-compilable JSON value model: a JsonValue DU with ergonomic builders + total (never-throwing) accessors, and a host-bridged serialization seam (browser JSON under Fable, System.Text.Json on .NET) with byte-stable object key order. Neutral wire-mapping substrate shared by server and browser hosts. FSharp.Core + Fable.Core only — no System.Net.Http, no unguarded System.Text.Json.",
